{"_id":"68dce5b0166b018f83df766d","roadmapSlug":"css","nodeId":"9ZUXy6s9IAIEM5GHk_bXR","description":"# CSS\n\nCSS (Cascading Style Sheets) is a language used to describe the presentation of a document written in HTML or XML. It controls the layout, colors, fonts, and other visual aspects of web pages, ensuring a consistent and visually appealing user experience across different devices and screen sizes. Essentially, CSS separates the content of a webpage from its design, making websites easier to maintain and update.","resources":[{"type":"course","title":"Responsive Web Design Certification - Co-Learn HTML & CSS with guided projects","url":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/learn/responsive-web-design-v9/","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144dd"},{"type":"course","title":"Web.dev by Google ΓÇö Learn CSS","url":"https://web.dev/learn/css/","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144de"},{"type":"article","title":"Visit Dedicated JavaScript Roadmap","url":"https://roadmap.sh/css","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144df"},{"type":"video","title":"CSS Complete Course","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n4R2E7O-Ngo","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144e0"},{"type":"video","title":"HTML & CSS Full Course - Beginner to Pro","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G3e-cpL7ofc","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144e1"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about CSS","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/css?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a67293033d15c83102144e2"}],"createdAt":"2025-10-01T08:26:24.952Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-27T09:47:28.129Z","lessonPacks":[{"_id":"6a22adddac1c5fa9928ab3ab","title":"CSS Fundamentals","slug":"css","description":"Style, lay out, and debug real pages without fighting the cascade.","lessonIds":["6a15d62fac1c5fa9928a3fb6","6a15e1b0ac1c5fa9928a403f","6a16f11aac1c5fa9928a7c14","6a19dcdfac1c5fa9928a84a5","6a19e79cac1c5fa9928a8571","6a19f85cac1c5fa9928a8654","6a1d7a23ac1c5fa9928a8b4e","6a1dd2daac1c5fa9928a9884","6a1ecf18ac1c5fa9928a9a81","6a1f3245ac1c5fa9928a9cdd","6a20aa64ac1c5fa9928aa44a","6a20ba69ac